hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"345","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd Sa'idi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Log hamesha bhalai mein rahenge jab tak iftar mein jaldi karte rahen.'"
"346","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyib (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Log hamesha bhalai mein rahenge jab tak iftar mein jaldi karte rahen aur mashriq walon [ghulu karne walon] ki tarah takheer na karen.'"
"347","[AI-translation] Asim bin Umar (Rahimahullah) se apne walid [Umar Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab din chala jae aur raat aa jae aur suraj ghurub ho jae to beshak rozedar ne iftar kar liya [iftar ka waqt aa gaya].'"
